  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "放任史莱姆成长会换来更多资源但让敌人更强，提前击杀则降低收益与风险。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In Slimekeep, every slime will grow over time. You can decide between letting slimes grow for more resources, at the cost of them becoming more powerful. Or, if you'd like, kill off the slimes early, providing less resources, but making for an easier, and less risky fight.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1552500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "捕获枪抽取史莱姆精华升级宠物，并可沿蛮力、刺客或特殊能力路线培养。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "If you'd like to take a more passive route to combat, you can capture slimes with a specially crafted capture gun, capable of extracting essence out of slimes, which can be used to upgrade your slime pet. Choose one, or many paths to build your slime pet around, from brute to assassin to specialty.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1552500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "史莱姆王巢穴可在流程中随时挑战，把终局首领变成玩家主动选择的时间点。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "And to beat the game, all you have to do is defeat the dreaded slime king, in which you can visit at any time.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1552500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
